Protocol: KeyLookup_v5_TLSChannels

Types:
  Agent A,X,IdP;
  Number N_A;
  Function pk;
  Format f1,f2;

Knowledge:
  A: A,X,IdP,pk(IdP);
  IdP: IdP,A,X,pk(IdP),inv(pk(IdP)),pk(X);

Actions:

  [A] *->* IdP: f1(A,X,N_A)
  IdP *->* [A]: f2(A,X,pk(X),N_A)

Goals:
  A authenticates IdP on pk(X),N_A
